[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5107607504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121867#issuecomment-5107607504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121867","id":5107607504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMG_n0A","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T17:37:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T17:39:28Z","body":"Note that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/77261 also implements this, albeit with `--color never` instead of `--no-color`.\r\n\r\n> Ideally, we'd be able to parse and filter out disabled ANSI immediately prior to output being printed, instead of this manual approach that's largely isolated to error outputs and --help.\r\n\r\nFile logging already strips ANSI using a regex: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90900\r\n\r\nThis ensures it works on `print_rich()` output, or even `print()` with manually inserted ANSI escape codes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5107607504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5107779324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121867#issuecomment-5107779324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121867","id":5107779324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMHKG_A","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-28T17:54:07Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T17:54:07Z","body":"> File logging already strips ANSI using a regex: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90900\r\n\r\nI'm aware of that much, though it's currently not guaranteed that regex will be present. Once #115474 is integrated, then it should be feasible to actually utilize it universally. I suppose I could adjust this PR with that implementation in mind and mark this as draft until then; will give that some thought later today.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5107779324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5224821259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121867#issuecomment-5224821259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121867","id":5224821259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN2xyCw","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-08T05:56:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T05:56:51Z","body":"Working as expected, tested on Linux Manjaro KDE with the following scripts:\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Main scene\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar pipe := OS.execute_with_pipe(\"godot\", [\"-s\", \"res://test.gd\"], false)  # Add \"--color\" argument\r\n\tvar pid := pipe.get(\"pid\", 0) as int\r\n\twhile OS.is_process_running(pid):\r\n\t\tvar stdio := pipe.get(\"stdio\", null) as FileAccess\r\n\t\tif stdio:\r\n\t\t\tprintraw(stdio.get_as_text())\r\n\t\tvar stderr := pipe.get(\"stderr\", null) as FileAccess\r\n\t\tif stderr:\r\n\t\t\tprintraw(stderr.get_as_text())\r\n\tawait get_tree().process_frame\r\n\tget_tree().quit(0)\r\n\r\n# test.gd (standalone script)\r\nextends SceneTree\r\n\r\nfunc _initialize() -> void:\r\n\tprint_rich(\"[color=blue]with color[/color] and without color\")\r\n\tpush_warning(\"pushed warning\")\r\n\tpush_error(\"pushed error\")\r\n\tquit(0)\r\n```\r\nWithout `--color`, or with `--no-color` (including both), all output from `test.gd` has its colors stripped.\r\nWith `--color`, all colored text (`Godot Engine`, `print_rich()` and the pushed warning/error) retains its colors.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"860\" height=\"450\" alt=\"output\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5432509e-e3a0-4961-8d8a-487ce309fd43\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5224821259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352595028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121867#issuecomment-5352595028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121867","id":5352595028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPwoeVA","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T07:08:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T07:08:35Z","body":"Here is an example of GitLab CI output without and with `--color` (custom image cherry-picking this PR), which makes it much easier to find errors and other interesting bits in the logs:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"740\" alt=\"ci_no_color\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6447586-a6fb-4a55-9f56-feb05065ad53\" />\r\n<img width=\"1050\" height=\"740\" alt=\"ci_color\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf6015d1-bf13-4f25-a2fa-cf16210c36b0\" />\r\n\r\nNote that with this PR and `--no-color`, the green line in the first image would probably be white instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352595028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]